- [Wallet](https://givebutter.com/wallet): Turn donations into mission-driving rewards. Earn 2.5% APY rewards on the funds you raise, send payments, and transfer funds from one seamless financial home base.
- [Integrations](https://givebutter.com/integrations): Connect Givebutter with 1,000+ third-party applications via Zapier, use any of our native integrations such as Bloomerang, or build your own with our public API.
- [Givebutter Plus](https://givebutter.com/plus): Add Givebutter Plus to your account for game-changing workflow automations, deeper donor insights, and eye-popping supporter engagement features to help your nonprofit go from surviving to thriving. Includes advanced email editor, nonprofit texting tools, and discounted direct mail campaigns. 

