- [Pledge donations](https://givebutter.com/features/pledges): No more missed donations. Log, track, and collect 100% of pledged donations while fostering stronger donor relationships with free pledge management software.
- [Cash App donations](https://givebutter.com/features/cash-app): Boost conversion rates and give mobile-first donors a smoother way to give with free Cash App donations on Givebutter—easy setup, minimal transaction fees.

